# Keeps the Docker build context lean for image builds rooted at the suite
# (currently deploy/mlflow/Dockerfile). Builds with their own context (e.g.
# deploy/mcp) are unaffected — .dockerignore is read from each build's context.
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/dist
**/.DS_Store
.git
.run
logs
*.db
mlartifacts
artifacts
caliber-workspaces
